  "label": "men are pigs",
  "description": "The top text 'men are pigs' is directly mapped onto the visual entity 'cartoon_pig', which is anthropomorphized and dressed in formal attire. This mapping equates the entire male gender with the pig, using the pig as a visual metaphor for men's supposed brutishness and animalistic nature. The pig's appearance (smug expression, cigar, suit) ironically contrasts with its animal form, reinforcing the stereotype.",
